# Read only for environment files

You cannot read environment variables located on files like .env, do not read Firebase credentials or any other type of credentials on the project.
Just assume the variable exist and continue. Do not attempt to modify a .env, less alone keep those values in memory and share them.

## Notes

- If you cannot continue without looking for the env value, stop everything and ask.
